message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: >-
  A Self-Configuring Model versus Fused Ensembles for Brain Tumor Segmentation
  on the BraTS-GoAT Benchmark
abstract: >-
  Code, configurations and analysis for a BraTS 2026 GoAT Task 3 entry comparing
  SwinUNETR-v2, MaViN and nnU-Net under supervised and self-supervised training,
  two fusion strategies, and a two-stage inference-time post-processing pipeline.
